@startuml
actor Engineer
participant "Control Studio" as Studio
participant "Search protocol handler" as Handler
participant "Loaded SourceRegistry + simulation snapshot" as Snapshot
participant "Bounded SearchService" as Service
participant "Disposable worker process" as Worker
participant "Fresh compiled ST runtime" as Runtime
participant "Fresh SimulationController" as Plant
Engineer -> Studio: Review finite grid, conditions and budgets
Studio -> Handler: start(expected project revision, complete declaration)
Handler -> Snapshot: Freeze bounded loaded ST + simulation.toml
Handler -> Service: Validate exact Cartesian count and conflicts
loop Every explicit candidate
Service -> Worker: Immutable snapshot + candidate (bounded stdin)
Worker -> Worker: OS memory limit before parsing / compiling
Worker -> Runtime: Compile fresh ST and seed parameters / initial state
Worker -> Plant: Construct fresh configured simulation + shared seed
loop Declared scan sequence
Worker -> Plant: Pre-cycle input update
Worker -> Runtime: Execute actual ST with instruction deadline
Worker -> Runtime: Read observed channels
Worker -> Plant: Post-cycle plant advance
end
Worker --> Service: RecordedRun + constraint status + ISE
Service -> Service: Reject violations before ranking; bound retained output
end
Studio -> Service: status(job, project revision)
Service --> Studio: Actual results, provenance, qualifying ranking
Studio -> Service: cancel(job, project revision)
Service -> Worker: Kill and reap on cancellation / wall budget
@enduml
